        "draft": false,
        "pull_request": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/k8s-buildkite-plugin-public/pulls/1",
          "merged_at": "2022-08-17T16:39:18Z"
        },
        "body": "The plugin assumes the step container is always index 0 of the container array for the statuses/spec. This may not be true with sidecar deployments. Fetch the index of the step container and use it when checking container statuses.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, declare the step container to be the default logging/exec source.  ",
